WEBVTT

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:33.410
The 6th lunar month.

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:38.000
Snails aren't the only ones who enjoy the rain.

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:41.670
It's raining, mom! It's raining!

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:43.560
You're right. It's raining.

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:44.890
Today for sure...!

00:01:49.580 --> 00:01:50.620
She's here!

00:01:50.720 --> 00:01:51.770
She sure is.

00:02:01.890 --> 00:02:04.110
What's she doing?

00:02:04.660 --> 00:02:07.910
Is she dancing? Or maybe playing?

00:02:08.740 --> 00:02:10.720
It also looks like she's praying.

00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:18.350
Drizzling Rain in the 6th Lunar Month

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:55.420
What are you doing?

00:02:55.720 --> 00:03:00.010
Even though it's our backyard, going outside naked is not something a girl should do.

00:03:00.620 --> 00:03:02.180
The only people who would do that are...

00:03:02.710 --> 00:03:03.530
...old men.

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:06.230
Let's go in together, Sunao!

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:11.790
What? Pote too?

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:15.670
When it's raining, Guchuko is outside the whole time too.

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:17.810
Isn't that what it's like to be a kid?

00:03:18.690 --> 00:03:19.750
I guess.

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:24.460
Just when is she going to start using that hut?

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:30.980
Back Stretching

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:30.940
She is currently using it.

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:36.800
You can't let her play outside, Sunao!

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:39.770
It'd be a problem for Pote-tan if she catches a cold too!

00:03:40.340 --> 00:03:40.820
"Too"?

00:03:41.260 --> 00:03:42.760
Yeah. To tell you the truth...

00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:44.810
It happened yesterday...

00:03:47.570 --> 00:03:50.110
Let's take shelter somewhere, Mutan.

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:51.050
Yeah.

00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:52.590
Let's go over there!

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:03.480
It just rained so suddenly. We're unlucky.

00:04:03.650 --> 00:04:06.370
Yeah. It really gets to me.

00:04:06.790 --> 00:04:09.300
We both forgot our umbrellas too.

00:04:09.740 --> 00:04:10.670
Yeah.

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:16.840
Did it calm down a bit?

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:18.890
No, not at all!

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:20.670
Really?

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:23.830
I think it'd be better if we stay here a bit longer.

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:26.220
We'll be all wet though.

00:04:26.510 --> 00:04:28.660
I-It can't be helped because we don't have umbrellas.

00:04:29.110 --> 00:04:32.150
We took shelter there for nearly an hour.

00:04:32.940 --> 00:04:34.920
Would you normally catch a cold in that time?

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:37.420
You're perfectly fine though, right, Kirihara-kun?

00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:39.230
Yeah, I am.

00:04:39.930 --> 00:04:43.440
Just exactly what happened with Hatsushiba-kun?

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:46.160
Let's go back to that scene once more.

00:04:48.170 --> 00:04:49.620
Let's take shelter somewhere, Mutan.

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:49.940
Yeah.

00:04:50.210 --> 00:04:50.790
Let's go over there!

00:04:56.930 --> 00:04:59.400
It just rained so suddenly. We're unlucky.

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:02.540
Yeah. It really gets to me.

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:04.880
We both forgot our umbrellas too.

00:05:05.420 --> 00:05:06.390
Yeah.

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:08.890
His nipple is showing through.

00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:12.510
Did it calm down a bit?

00:05:12.630 --> 00:05:14.420
No, not at all!

00:05:15.730 --> 00:05:16.410
Really?

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:19.670
I think it'd be better if we stay here a bit longer.

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:21.990
We'll be all wet though.

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:24.620
I-It can't be helped because we don't have umbrellas.

00:05:26.420 --> 00:05:28.750
By the way, your eyes are kind of scary.

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:30.610
N-No they aren't!

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:33.190
I wonder what happened?

00:05:33.340 --> 00:05:34.130
Yeah.

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:41.070
Hatsushiba Kaoru is currently down with a 39°C fever.

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:42.950
His condition is...

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:45.250
Mu-Mutan!

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:47.360
...wavering it seems.

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:53.130
Well then, it's a bit abrupt but let's introduce his family.

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:54.860
Here is Kaoru's papa.

00:05:55.140 --> 00:05:55.740
I'm his papa.

00:05:55.970 --> 00:05:57.230
Here is Kaoru's mama.

00:05:57.370 --> 00:05:58.110
I'm his mama.

00:05:58.230 --> 00:05:59.710
Here is Kaoru's little sister.

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:00.750
I'm his little sister.

00:06:01.350 --> 00:06:02.510
Here is Kaoru's dog.

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:08.860
A-Aren't you ashamed, Mutan...

00:06:08.870 --> 00:06:11.390
Another lifestyle disease delivered.

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:19.670
Look. We made that for her to take shelter from the rain.

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:22.150
She just won't go in.

00:06:24.060 --> 00:06:25.790
Is she playing it safe?

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:27.900
I don't think that's it.

00:06:32.140 --> 00:06:33.830
She's here. She's here!

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:44.380
What's she doing?

00:06:44.890 --> 00:06:46.810
Maybe her back is itchy.

00:06:47.250 --> 00:06:48.490
Don't you mean her butt?

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:50.890
Later!

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:52.640
Bye. See you soon.

00:06:55.190 --> 00:06:58.030
Just speak up! You won't mind a slave hut, right?

00:06:58.240 --> 00:07:00.170
You're saying that again!

00:06:59.760 --> 00:07:01.570
It'll be like a hawk's nest.

00:07:02.780 --> 00:07:04.500
I won't get you an air conditioner though.

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:05.130
Hey!

00:07:05.290 --> 00:07:07.590
They say winter is cold and summer is hot.

00:07:07.730 --> 00:07:09.320
There's something wrong with that!

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:11.770
I guess it'd be a waste on you.

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:13.430
What'd you say!?

00:07:16.630 --> 00:07:17.460
Shut up!

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:18.820
Nene-sama!

00:07:20.150 --> 00:07:21.590
It's about time for you to change into your dinner dress.

00:07:22.060 --> 00:07:23.690
Okay. I'm going now.

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:29.860
Geez. Just how long is she going to mess with me?

00:07:37.980 --> 00:07:40.340
She's pretty cute when she shuts up.

00:07:51.800 --> 00:07:53.950
Mutan! Mutan!

00:07:54.520 --> 00:07:58.030
I understand her though. I feel like going out when it rains.

00:07:58.650 --> 00:08:01.210
I got yelled a lot for doing that in the past.

00:08:03.430 --> 00:08:07.440
The smell of the water, the greenery and the soil...

00:08:10.890 --> 00:08:15.340
I'd lie down and it'd feel like the earth would melt. It was fun.

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:20.030
But I would get mistaken as a corpse sometimes.

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:23.990
Hey! She's over here! The dead person's here!

00:08:25.620 --> 00:08:28.470
And dogs would pee on me too!

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:31.430
That's fun?

00:08:34.050 --> 00:08:34.750
It's raining again.

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:57.290
Hey, Yasumi! Bring in the clothes!

00:08:57.700 --> 00:08:58.760
Yasumi!

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:00.710
I heard you!

00:09:13.930 --> 00:09:16.180
Why are you eating with your left hand?

00:09:21.260 --> 00:09:23.720
At that time, Kirihara Mudo-kun was...

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:26.920
Pote-tan is the best after all!

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:29.500
Pote-tan is so moé!

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:37.830
Why did I think she was cute?

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:44.950
Kaoru!

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:46.670
Kaoru!

00:09:46.470 --> 00:09:48.950
He's urgently being hospitalized for pneumonia.

00:10:08.130 --> 00:10:09.280
Only for a little while, okay?

00:10:30.850 --> 00:10:32.930
It's warmer than I thought.

00:10:38.510 --> 00:10:40.900
Summer is going to come soon.

00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:01.960
It's somehow...

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:04.220
She's right but wrong.

00:11:49.030 --> 00:11:54.850
Time for New Leaves

00:12:06.930 --> 00:12:09.610
Sorry, sorry. It hurts when I pull on it?

00:12:20.150 --> 00:12:21.980
No matter how I look at it, it's two leaves.

00:12:22.580 --> 00:12:25.090
They're coming directly out of her head so...

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:29.370
...a seed flew in from somewhere and took root on her head?

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:31.690
Then that means...

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:41.850
Sorry, sorry. I won't touch it again, okay?

00:12:47.020 --> 00:12:47.730
They're splendid, huh?

00:12:49.800 --> 00:12:51.380
She seems completely fine.

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:55.590
Maybe it just comes naturally when she grows bigger.

00:12:56.900 --> 00:12:58.750
Oh yeah, what about Guchuko?

00:13:02.150 --> 00:13:02.850
Three leaves.

00:13:13.360 --> 00:13:14.350
It's sprouting from her!

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:15.370
Amazing!

00:13:15.630 --> 00:13:16.960
What are you all staring out?

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:17.980
Well...

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:20.550
Blah-blah yadda-yadda

00:13:18.510 --> 00:13:20.210
Currently in the middle of explaining.

00:13:21.800 --> 00:13:23.570
This is a battle.

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:24.330
Battle?

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:27.380
That's right. A battle to see who's leaves grow bigger!

00:13:27.630 --> 00:13:28.720
I'm getting fired up!

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:32.120
That's right! When speaking of plant battles...

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:35.390
I discovered something big researching morning-glories for class!

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:38.100
Morning-glories grow counter-clockwise!

00:13:38.720 --> 00:13:40.160
Peru's tail is clockwise!

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:42.480
Peru is a shiba dog by the way.

00:13:44.180 --> 00:13:46.710
You're remembering something stupid again, aren't you?

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:50.420
It's not stupid! It's a big discovery!

00:13:56.800 --> 00:13:59.260
Alright, Pote! Let's start right away!

00:14:00.320 --> 00:14:01.780
What are you planning to do?

00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:03.210
Well, for now...

00:14:03.680 --> 00:14:04.950
...let's aim for three leaves!

00:14:06.140 --> 00:14:08.570
Professor Morning-glory is going to be your trainer for today!

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:10.960
There are three points to take into consideration.

00:14:12.480 --> 00:14:14.920
First of all, you need nutrients!

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:15.810
And...

00:14:16.420 --> 00:14:17.390
...sunlight!

00:14:20.360 --> 00:14:21.620
You're like this all the time though.

00:14:23.690 --> 00:14:25.880
What's the last point?

00:14:26.490 --> 00:14:30.320
Which reminds me...you were excited on rainy days because of this, right?

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:32.950
Moisture, huh?

00:14:45.840 --> 00:14:48.400
I-I'm sorry, Pote! Are you okay?

00:14:52.380 --> 00:14:55.580
From now on, think before you take action, okay?

00:14:57.920 --> 00:14:58.370
Chick.

00:14:59.680 --> 00:15:01.750
Look after her while I have gym.

00:15:09.270 --> 00:15:10.610
Pass! Pass!

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:12.420
Hey, keep attacking!

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:13.780
Alright!

00:15:14.150 --> 00:15:15.750
Nice head, Moriyama!

00:15:18.090 --> 00:15:22.160
Hey Moriyama, I know you're worried about Pote but,

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:24.330
you should pay attention in class.

00:15:25.810 --> 00:15:26.290
Chick.

00:15:27.550 --> 00:15:28.620
I'm counting on you.

00:15:35.090 --> 00:15:36.750
She's all fine now.

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:38.680
Her leaves are too.

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:40.440
Hey, let me hold her!

00:15:41.060 --> 00:15:42.230
I'm next.

00:15:42.230 --> 00:15:44.420
Don't fight and get in line!

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:48.990
"There's a limit to how cute two-leaf Pote-tan can be."

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:50.570
...is what you're thinking right?

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:54.580
"At least let me hold her, you bastards!"

00:15:55.440 --> 00:15:56.710
...is what you're thinking, right?

00:15:56.940 --> 00:15:58.500
S-Shut up.

00:15:58.690 --> 00:16:00.820
And you're dream is something like this!

00:16:01.760 --> 00:16:03.440
On one sunny day...

00:16:04.220 --> 00:16:08.030
...I was awakened by Pote-tan's small and soft fingers.

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:14.410
I quickly awoke to play and I gently held you.

00:16:14.970 --> 00:16:16.880
In that direction, a hot...

00:16:17.530 --> 00:16:18.180
I'm bored.

00:16:19.090 --> 00:16:20.850
H-Hold on! Keep going!

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:21.790
Mutan.

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:26.110
I-I'm not thinking that, idiots!

00:16:27.680 --> 00:16:30.780
What? You were thinking something like this too?

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:31.980
You're a demon.

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:33.420
What is it now?

00:16:33.920 --> 00:16:35.750
"You're so cute, Nene-sama!"

00:16:38.630 --> 00:16:39.650
Just kidding!

00:16:40.200 --> 00:16:41.820
Mop the floor you good-for-nothing.

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:43.590
Mutan...

00:16:46.390 --> 00:16:48.300
Be careful on your way home, Pote!

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:51.050
She's all better now.

00:16:51.350 --> 00:16:53.990
Yeah. She can even go home alone.

00:16:55.770 --> 00:16:56.430
Alone?

00:16:58.970 --> 00:17:00.690
Moriyama-kun!

00:17:01.850 --> 00:17:04.870
Su-nao!

00:17:08.720 --> 00:17:12.680
You don't need to worry. I don't think anyone cares.

00:17:13.030 --> 00:17:15.990
Oh, that's right. I saw a movie last time.

00:17:16.290 --> 00:17:18.780
The main character, Alexander the Great, was very...

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:20.810
And the next day...

00:17:24.590 --> 00:17:27.210
Listen, Potemayo. Take it moderately.

00:17:30.550 --> 00:17:31.150
It's Guchuko.

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:33.460
She really has three leaves!

00:17:34.890 --> 00:17:35.580
Potemayo!

00:17:36.020 --> 00:17:38.160
It's more splendid that Pote's leaves.

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:38.890
Yeah.

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:44.580
Here it is! Here it is!

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:46.240
I wonder what's going to happen?

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:48.190
This battle is getting everyone's attention.

00:17:53.820 --> 00:17:54.450
She got ignored.

00:17:59.520 --> 00:18:00.520
How pitiful.

00:18:01.090 --> 00:18:03.220
Her opponent just doesn't have the same feeling as her.

00:18:03.650 --> 00:18:04.210
Yeah.

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:07.250
By the way, who's lunch is Guchuko eating?

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:09.410
Didn't Takamimori give her it?

00:18:13.100 --> 00:18:15.170
My lunch!

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:18.260
Mutan! I'll give my lunch, Mutan!

00:18:31.820 --> 00:18:34.200
I think she's saying she wants to grow up quickly.

00:18:35.140 --> 00:18:36.370
That's amazing, Mikan.

00:18:36.620 --> 00:18:37.620
It was just a feeling.

00:18:40.100 --> 00:18:43.840
Listen, Potemayo. You shouldn't hurry and grow up so quickly.

00:18:45.510 --> 00:18:48.250
I'm sure it'll be bad for your body when you do something unnatural.

00:18:49.930 --> 00:18:50.710
That's right.

00:18:51.070 --> 00:18:54.680
Instead of competing to see who's grows faster, you should compete to see who's is bigger and more beautiful.

00:18:55.700 --> 00:18:58.170
I wonder if you two are going to have flowers bloom?

00:18:59.680 --> 00:19:00.860
Right, flowers.

00:19:10.230 --> 00:19:11.460
Hey, what are you doing?

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:13.590
You can't just take it out!

00:19:14.030 --> 00:19:16.350
You have to go through the right procedures!

00:19:17.400 --> 00:19:19.410
You want to be a weeping bell?

00:19:20.370 --> 00:19:22.080
She's quite the maniac.

00:19:22.410 --> 00:19:23.240
This is a flower?

00:19:23.940 --> 00:19:25.940
It's something a leaf turns into.

00:19:37.120 --> 00:19:38.810
It'll be fun to see it grow.

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:41.040
I guess.

00:19:43.890 --> 00:19:49.760
Hey, they say that it's good for them if you say that they're pretty and talk to them a lot everyday.

00:19:50.970 --> 00:19:55.900
If the owner pours all their love and tells them that they're pretty, the flower will give it their all.

00:19:57.840 --> 00:19:58.680
Really?

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:02.020
Girls are the same too!

00:20:02.690 --> 00:20:05.160
Girls become pretty when they receive a lot of love!

00:20:05.630 --> 00:20:06.970
That's right, everyone...

00:20:07.960 --> 00:20:09.720
...a pretty weeping bell!

00:20:10.820 --> 00:20:11.220
Huh?

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:28.900
They say that it's good for them if you say that they're pretty and talk to them a lot everyday.

00:20:30.570 --> 00:20:32.660
Su-nao! Suna-o!

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:38.390
Pr...Pret...ty...

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:44.860
Then let's at least talk.

00:20:46.370 --> 00:20:50.520
A long, long time ago in a distant land, there were three little pig brothers.

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:53.790
They went to see their grandmother...

00:21:01.370 --> 00:21:04.930
How about a story from when I was young?

00:21:07.230 --> 00:21:10.570
When I was young, I traveled to many countries.

00:21:11.280 --> 00:21:13.650
I knew it was because of dad's job but,

00:21:14.260 --> 00:21:18.550
what kind of job it is, I'm still not sure till this day.

00:21:29.090 --> 00:21:31.670
Su-nao! Suna-o!

00:21:47.640 --> 00:21:48.590
I'm glad for you.

00:21:51.770 --> 00:21:52.490
A flower bud.
